### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### List products
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/products

### Products summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/products/summary

### Supported import hosts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/imports/supported-stores

### Preview supported product URL
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/imports/url-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_url": "https://demo.ksp.local/products/sony-wh1000xm5"
}

### Create product
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sony WH-1000XM5",
  "store": "KSP Demo",
  "product_url": "https://demo.ksp.local/products/sony-wh1000xm5",
  "image_url": "https://pisces.bbystatic.com/image2/BestBuy_US/images/products/6505/6505727_rd.jpg%3BmaxHeight%3D1920%3BmaxWidth%3D900?format=webp",
  "current_price": 1299.9,
  "target_price": 999.9,
  "currency": "ILS",
  "is_active": true
}

### Get product by id
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/products/1

### Update product
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_price": 949.9,
  "is_active": false
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/products/1

### Login as demo admin
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@priceradar.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Weekly digest
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/reports/weekly-digest
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Trigger refresh
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/refresh/run
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Alert events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/alerts/events

### Local sent email outbox
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/alerts/email-outbox

### Branded sent email preview
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/alerts/email-preview
